---
// 两个权重的损失等高线：静态示意梯度下降在「看不见全貌」时怎么走
const CENTER = { x: 318, y: 170 };
const RINGS = [1, 2, 3, 4].map((k) => ({
  rx: k * 60,
  ry: k * 33,
}));
// 起点 P、第一步 P2、下一步方向终点 P3
const P = { x: 468, y: 92 };
const P2 = { x: 410, y: 122 };
const P3 = { x: 362, y: 147 };
---

<section class="loss-landscape not-content" aria-label="两个权重的损失等高线示意">
  <figure class="loss-landscape__figure">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 640 340" role="img" aria-label="损失等高线图：四圈椭圆降向中心谷底，圆点从右上方山坡沿梯度反方向迈出一步，再重新判断下一步坡向">
      <title>损失等高线与梯度下降的一步</title>
      <defs>
        <marker id="ls-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5.5" markerHeight="5.5" orient="auto">
          <path d="M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z" style="fill: var(--training-heading)" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="ls-arrow-muted" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5.5" markerHeight="5.5" orient="auto">
          <path d="M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z" style="fill: var(--training-muted)" />
        </marker>
      </defs>
      <line class="ls-axis" x1="56" y1="308" x2="612" y2="308" />
      <line class="ls-axis" x1="56" y1="308" x2="56" y2="28" />
      <text class="ls-axis-label" x="610" y="330" text-anchor="end">权重 w₁ →</text>
      <text class="ls-axis-label" x="66" y="26">↑ 权重 w₂</text>
      {RINGS.map((r) => (
        <ellipse class="ls-contour" cx={CENTER.x} cy={CENTER.y} rx={r.rx} ry={r.ry} />
      ))}
      <text class="ls-dir-label" x={CENTER.x - 168} y={CENTER.y - 96}>外圈损失高（山坡）</text>
      <circle class="ls-min" cx={CENTER.x} cy={CENTER.y} r="6.5" />
      <text class="ls-min-label" x={CENTER.x - 10} y={CENTER.y + 26} text-anchor="middle">谷底：损失最低</text>
      <line class="ls-gradient" x1={P.x - 7} y1={P.y + 3.6} x2={P2.x + 9} y2={P2.y - 4.7} />
      <line class="ls-gradient ls-gradient--next" x1={P2.x - 7} y1={P2.y + 3.6} x2={P3.x} y2={P3.y} marker-end="url(#ls-arrow-muted)" />
      <circle class="ls-ball" cx={P.x} cy={P.y} r="7" />
      <text class="ls-step-label" x={P.x + 12} y={P.y - 6}>① 起点：随机参数</text>
      <circle class="ls-ball ls-ball--next" cx={P2.x} cy={P2.y} r="7" />
      <text class="ls-step-label" x={P2.x + 16} y={P2.y + 22}>② 迈一步 Δw = −η∇L</text>
      <text class="ls-dir-label" x={P3.x - 12} y={P3.y - 24} text-anchor="end">③ 下一步再摸坡向</text>
    </svg>
    <figcaption>同一圈椭圆代表损失相等，越靠中间海拔越低。程序看不到整张地图，只能原地测一下脚下哪边下坡最陡，迈一步再重测。</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <p class="lesson-diagram__note loss-landscape__note">
    1 个权重是一条山谷曲线，2 个权重是这张等高线地图，大模型里的上亿权重只是更高维的山地——走法完全一样：沿梯度的反方向，按学习率迈步。
  </p>
</section>
